WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.470
Translate complete messages
with meaning notes,

2
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.653
placeholder roles, length limits,

3
00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:06.952
and shared terms.

4
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.947
General Translation translates
each marked block with the context

5
00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:11.956
note beside it.

6
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.042
Free can mean costs nothing,

7
00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:16.562
or that a seat is available.

8
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.224
In React, the context prop on
&lt;T&gt; says the seat is available.

9
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.833
For existing JSON catalogs,

10
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:27.385
a metadata file beside the source
adds a note and length limit

11
00:00:27.385 --> 00:00:28.081
per key.

12
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.087
Your Glossary and Custom Prompts
apply through Context Groups,

13
00:00:32.087 --> 00:00:34.524
and reviewers correct
output in the Dashboard.

14
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.843
Your team now ships
German with each release.
